SUMMARY:Deadline: Foresight Institute AI Nodes RFP\, Track II: Coordination
  and Accountability
DESCRIPTION:Track II of Foresight Institute's AI for Science & Safety Nodes
  RFP funds ways for increasingly capable AI systems to coordinate with eac
 h other\, the people using them\, and the wider world\, without handing po
 wer to a single model\, lab or government.\n\nOrganisation: Foresight Inst
 itute\nLocation: Remote (global\; hubs in San Francisco and Berlin)\nAward
 : Typically $30\,000 to $100\,000 per grant\, with smaller amounts for the
  Human Empowerment and AI Insurance & Open Governance focus areas\; plus p
 rivate local compute and workspace at the San Francisco or Berlin AI Nodes
 . No application fee.\nDuration: Project-based\n\nMore: https://foresight.
 org/grants/ai-science-safety-nodes-rfp-coordination-and-accountability/?ut
