DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Deadline: Foresight Institute AI Nodes RFP\, Track III: AI-First Sc
 ience (Bio\, Neuro\, Nano)
DESCRIPTION:Track III of Foresight Institute's AI for Science & Safety Node
 s RFP funds AI-first science in bio\, neuro and nano: work that asks what 
 important science is stuck\, what it is actually stuck on\, and whether we
  can build the thing that removes that constraint.\n\nOrganisation: Foresi
 ght Institute\nLocation: Remote (global\; hubs in San Francisco and Berlin
 )\nAward: Typically $30\,000 to $100\,000 per grant\, with higher amounts 
 for this track than the Human Empowerment and AI Insurance areas (larger p
 ossible for the right project)\; plus private local compute and workspace 
 at the San Francisco or Berlin AI Nodes. No application fee.\nDuration: Pr
 oject-based\n\nMore: https://foresight.org/grants/ai-science-safety-nodes-
 rfp-ai-first-science/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=ref
 erral
